<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stryker Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stryker Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jeffries &amp; Co Inc said it downgraded Stryker Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited the recent increase in Stryker's stock price.</p>
<p>-- said Stryker is a &quot;world class medical device company&quot; with the &quot;most diversified product line and widest international reach of any medical device company its size.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said Stryker can continue to grow earnings per share at 20 percent annual rate.</p>
<p>-- Stryker lost 7/8 to 32.</p>
</text>
